desc 1 1 Text="1/You are in the village square.# A dry fountain stands in the middle.#+/"
desc 1 2 Text="1/#Roads lead north and south; an inn lies east, a temple west.#/"
desc 1 3 Text="2/You are on the north road./You are on a rutted road north of the village./"
desc 1 4 Text="1/You are in the Gilded Goose.# Stairs climb to a loft; a newsstand is north.#/"
desc 1 5 Text="1/You are in the market.# A smithy smokes to the east; a pawnshop lies west.#/"
desc 1 6 Text="1/You are in the temple.# Candles burn before a plain stone altar.#/"
desc 1 7 Text="1/You are at the edge of a dark forest.# A ruined tower rises to the east.#/"
desc 1 8 Text="1/You are in the inn's loft.# It smells of hay and old wine.#/"
desc 1 9 Text="2/You are deep in the forest./You are among tall pines.# Something howls.#/"
desc 1 10 Text="1/You are at the foot of a ruined tower.# Steps climb into the dark.#/"
desc 2 1 Text="1/You are somewhere new./"
desc 2 2 Text="1/You are in a damp cellar.# Bones crunch underfoot.#/"
desc 2 3 Text="1/You are in a quiet glade.# A circle of white stones hums softly.#/"
desc 2 4 Text="1/You are on Guild Street.# Halls stand south and west; the market is north.#/"
desc 2 5 Text="1/You are at the east end of Guild Street.# Steps lead down to a cellar.#/"
desc 2 6 Text="1/You are in the fighters' hall.# Racks of blunted swords line the walls.#/"
desc 2 7 Text="1/You are in the barbarians' longhouse.# A fire roars in a long stone pit.#/"
desc 2 8 Text="1/You are in the rangers' lodge.# Antlers and bowstaves hang from the beams.#/"
desc 2 9 Text="1/You are in the mages' college.# Chalked circles cover the floor.#/"
desc 2 10 Text="1/You are in the thieves' den.# Nobody here looks at you directly.#/"
desc 3 1 Text="2/A lean grey wolf, all ribs and teeth./A wolf with a torn ear./"
desc 3 2 Text="1/A goblin in a stolen helmet several sizes too big./"
desc 3 3 Text="1/A rat the size of a small dog./"
desc 3 4 Text="1/A skeleton held together by malice and old wire./"
desc 3 5 Text="1/A plain iron dagger, well oiled./"
desc 3 6 Text="1/An iron-bound chest with a brass lock./"
desc 3 7 Text="1/It reads: \"Tsogira reference world. Not for production.\"/"
desc 3 8 Text="1/A goblin in a cloak of crow feathers, muttering over a bundle of bones./"
desc 4 1 Text="1/You are in the cloister.# Acolytes pace beneath the arches.#/"
desc 4 2 Text="1/You are in the paladins' chapter house.# Shields bear the temple's sign.#/"
desc 4 3 Text="1/You are in the pawnshop.# Shelves sag under other people's things.#/"
desc 4 4 Text="1/You are in the smithy.# The forge glows and a hammer rings on the anvil.#/"
desc 4 5 Text="1/You are at the newsstand.# Broadsheets flap from a line over the counter.#/"
desc 4 6 Text="1/You are in the village lockup.# Damp straw and iron bars. Steps lead up.#/"
desc 4 7 Text="1/You are on the forest bridge.# Black water slides by below.#/"
desc 4 8 Text="1/You are in the wizards' workshop.# Scorch marks blacken the benches.#/"
desc 5 1 Text="1/A peddler with a tray of trinkets slung from a strap about his neck./"
desc 5 2 Text="2/Help!  Thieves!/Guards!  Guards!/"
desc 5 3 Text="1/Take what you like, only spare me!/"
desc 5 4 Text="1/I'll not forget your face, friend./"
desc 5 5 Text="1/Is this how the village treats an honest trader?/"
desc 5 6 Text="2/Fine goods, cheap!/Everything must go!/"
desc 5 7 Text="1/The road north is no place to walk alone after dark./"
desc 5 8 Text="1/They say the old tower is full of goblins./"
desc 5 9 Text="1/I'd sell you another, but my tray is bare./"
desc 5 10 Text="1/Come back when I've restocked, friend./"
desc 6 1 Text="1/A spider as big as a cartwheel, its fangs glistening./"
desc 6 2 Text="1/A wight, its eyes cold pinpricks in a withered face./"
desc 6 3 Text="1/A watchman in a dented helmet, leaning on his halberd./"
desc 6 4 Text="1/A pale, flickering shape that might once have been a man./"
desc 6 5 Text="1/A goblin with a tin crown and a very large club./"
desc 6 6 Text="1/A wand of ash wood, scorched at the tip./"
desc 6 7 Text="1/A ring of white standing stones, humming softly./"
desc 6 8 Text="1/A tarot card showing a tower struck by lightning./"
desc 6 9 Text="1/A red gem, cut square, warm to the touch./"
desc 6 10 Text="1/A slim silver dagger, engraved with runes./"
desc 7 3 Text="2/A first phrase./A second phrase./"
